            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em;text-align:center;">Income Generating Projects</h1>
            <p>At Human Relief Mission, we are committed to empowering the most vulnerable communities in Afghanistan by helping them break the cycle of poverty. Through our carefully designed Income Generating Projects (IGP), we provide long-term, sustainable income opportunities that enable individuals to regain dignity, support their families, and foster a thriving community for generations to come. By offering a means to secure a stable income, we help lift families out of poverty, giving them the tools they need to build a brighter and more prosperous future.</p>


            <h1 style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: center;">Our IGP  Projects in Afghanistan</h1>
            <h2 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em;">Chicken Carts</h2>
            <p>
                This project equips beneficiaries with a mobile chicken-selling cart, allowing them to start their own business in their local communities. The chicken cart offers a steady income stream by enabling individuals to sell fresh, locally sourced poultry, which is often in high demand. In addition to financial support, we provide guidance on halal business practices to ensure that their operations are both ethical and sustainable, benefiting both the vendors and the local population with access to fresh, affordable food.
            </p>

            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/IGP/checken-cart.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>

