            <h2 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em;">Fresh Fruit Juice Cart</h2>
            <p>Through our fresh juice cart project, beneficiaries are provided with the equipment and training needed to prepare and sell fresh fruit juice in busy areas. This business not only helps generate income but also promotes healthier living within the community by offering fresh, natural juice options. By providing access to popular products that are affordable and nutritious, individuals can build a business that benefits the entire community while securing a reliable income.</p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/IGP/juice-vending-carts.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
            </p>
            <h2 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em;">Sugarcane Cart</h2>
            <p>Sugarcane juice is a popular and refreshing drink in Afghanistan, and this project helps individuals tap into that demand. With a sugarcane cart, families are empowered to sell freshly squeezed sugarcane juice to local customers, creating a sustainable source of income. The simplicity of the business model, combined with the high demand for the product, makes this a valuable opportunity for individuals looking to start their own businesses and achieve self-sufficiency.</p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/IGP/sugarcane-vending-carts.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
            </p>

            <h2 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em;">Empowering Through Knowledge and Skills</h2>
            <p>Beyond simply providing the equipment needed for these ventures, Human Relief Mission ensures that each beneficiary receives comprehensive training in business management, ethical entrepreneurship, and halal practices. Our training programs focus on teaching individuals essential skills such as financial management, sales techniques, and customer service. This support helps beneficiaries to run their businesses effectively, ensuring long-term success. We also work closely with local community leaders to identify the most vulnerable households, prioritising those in greatest need for support.</p>

            <h2 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em;">Impact of Income Generating Projects</h2>
            <p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <h3 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:0.9em;display:inline;">Providing Sustainable Income:</h3>
                        Self-sustaining income generating projects offer families a stable source of income, enabling them to meet their essential needs such as food, shelter, and education. By providing reliable financial security, these projects help break the cycle of poverty and create a foundation for a better future.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:0.9em;display:inline;">Creating Employment Opportunities:</h3>
                        Our projects help create employment opportunities for individuals who may otherwise struggle to find work. By encouraging entrepreneurship and small business ownership, we help reduce unemployment and contribute to the economic growth of the local community. In turn, these businesses can also provide jobs for others, further stimulating economic activity.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:0.9em;display:inline;">Building Skills and Knowledge:</h3>
                        Our training programs are designed to equip individuals with the practical skills and knowledge needed to manage their businesses successfully. By developing skills in areas such as budgeting, marketing, and customer service, beneficiaries can achieve long-term self-sufficiency and pass on their knowledge to others, creating a ripple effect of positive change within the community.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <h3 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:0.9em;display:inline;">Encouraging Entrepreneurship:</h3>
                        Income generating projects foster a spirit of entrepreneurship, encouraging individuals to take control of their own destinies. By giving people the tools and support to start their own businesses, we help them become self-reliant and contribute to the economic development of their communities.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </p>

            <h2 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em;">A Path to Dignity and Self-Sufficiency</h2>
            @* Start Qoute Section*@
            <div class="" style="padding-bottom:50px;margin-top:30px;">

                <div class="quote-container col-md-12">
                    <span class="" style="font-size:4em;font-weight:bold">&lsquo;&lsquo;</span>
                    <p class="quote">
                        The Prophet ﷺ said: “The upper hand is better than the lower hand. The upper hand is the one that gives, and the lower hand is the one that takes.”
                    </p>
                    <p class="">Hadith | Sahih Bukhari</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            @* End Qoute Section*@
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <p>This hadith reminds us of the importance of giving people the means to support themselves and their families, allowing them to live with dignity and independence. At Human Relief Mission, we believe that empowering individuals with the tools to earn their own livelihood is one of the most impactful ways to uplift them out of poverty.</p>
            <p>Through your generous support, we can continue to provide life-changing opportunities in Afghanistan. By investing in these income generating projects, you are helping to create a sustainable path to independence, hope, and a brighter future for countless families. Together, we can transform lives and build stronger, more resilient communities in Afghanistan.</p>
        </div>
